# Normalise to LF in the repository. Without this, a clone on Windows can give
# docker-entrypoint.sh CRLF endings, and Alpine's sh then fails with a
# "bad interpreter" error that is genuinely confusing to diagnose.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh   text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf

*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
